# The Gate-1 ignition fixture. Its tree digest IS the slice's base revision
# (daedalus/ignition/gate1.py prepare_ignition_repo), so under CRLF the same
# commit produces a different base revision, candidate revision and graph delta
# per checkout -- while git reports both trees clean. MEASURED 2026-08-23:
# data/events.csv is 19 bytes in one worktree and 21 in another at the same
# commit, and the replay comparison between them refused with "produced from a
# different fixture tree". The module's own docstring promises "the same 40-hex
# sha on any machine"; this is what makes that true.
tests/fixtures/ignition/voltage/** -text

